# T1 key: 120 reviews of the 1-3 star stream, window 2026-05-23 .. 2026-09-22.
# Written 2026-11-02 by Claude from the review text alone, before any matching run,
# against the 22 topics in matrix.sample.yaml (frozen for this key; not edited after
# reading the sheet). Format: <review_id> <seq> <labels...>
#
# Conventions (set before labelling):
#  1. A unit gets every topic it is about, read within its review (context resolves
#     "it", "this"); it does not inherit topics from its review's other units.
#  2. Any second step at sign-in or before a payment (a code by text or call, an
#     approval on another device, "2FA") -> two-step-verification.
#  3. ID photo, selfie, identity check, making a phone trusted, the app not
#     remembering the phone -> trusted-device.
#  4. The card tap (NFC) or card PIN asked before an e-transfer -> etransfer-send;
#     with no e-transfer named, it fits no topic -> O.
#  5. technical-error only when the error message is quoted or referred to; a vague
#     "lots of technical problems" -> G.
#  6. app-crash-launch for crashing, freezing or not opening; "doesn't work" with
#     nothing more -> G.
#  7. Device, tablet, OS version, custom ROM, USB-debugging and "not compatible"
#     complaints -> device-support.
#  8. Phone, chat, branch, virtual assistant and agents -> customer-support.
#  9. A sign-in that fails or loops, with no topic's feature named -> O (the list
#     has no general sign-in topic). Direct Investing, dark mode, fees, card
#     management, credit limit offers -> O.
# 10. Switching banks, insults, praise, comparisons with no feature -> G. Account
#     history and filler -> N.

